# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (repository
# root). Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image; local
# env files hold secrets and must never reach an image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.atl
docs
odd
openspec
**/prod.env
